{"id":"vod_sn_36407","vodId":"36407","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"死神Bleach","name_cn":"死神Bleach","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第366集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1be6ed2c9d9d18f17b848a259b39b33f.jpg"},"summary":"橘发少年黑崎一护是个正义感爆棚的高中生，与父亲、两个妹妹共同生活，从小他就有能看见鬼魂的本事，但并不以为意。一天夜里一只叫“虚”的怪物攻击了一护和他的家人，尾随怪物而来的死神朽木露琪亚身负重伤，只得将灵力转给一护，由他代死神之职。岂料“代职”一发不可收拾，一段时间后，尸 魂界发现露琪亚的违规行为，来人将她抓走。为救出朋友，一护在浦原商店店主浦原喜助的帮助下，集结了井上织姬、石田雨龙、茶渡泰虎几位好友，一同前往尸魂界。与此同时，尸魂界瀞灵廷内一场惊天阴谋也在慢慢掀开……　　《死神》漫画于2001年开始在《少年JUMP周刊》连载，动画2004年开播。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":366,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zzH7T0Kbc21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A8piZkdBsR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y6Z5Ni9zQA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nxQqRff8tt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G5V54fGtEz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qkpXnAk0b81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/atiqzVvvxu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CzKnhSQT5Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5tiZfhf0FM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zDzd1heD6n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ebS9UC2SrF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/at6EtHxxww1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7fDeHGwcAc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/19yXVy8PMM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15